e":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"healthcare-lifesciences","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis tag is initially being created specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#big-rocks#aws-for-data","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#big-rocks","name":"AWS for Data","description":"\u003cp\u003eAWS for Data is a marketing \u0026ldquo;Big Rock\u0026rdquo; initiative that tells the story around how AWS can provide the most comprehensive set of data capabilities spanning databases, analytics, business intelligence, and machine learning for an end-to-end data strategy.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2024-02-14T22:32:15+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-02-14T22:32:15+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#marsmission12012021lkmapsreoenjaf","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"marsmission12012021lkmapsreoenjaf","dateCreated":"2022-05-23T21:42:22+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-05-23T21:52:54+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"The Emirates Mars Mission made history as the first Arabic nation to reach Mars in an unprecedented short amount of time. The Hope Probe will now spend two years gathering data from the red planet’s atmosphere, all of which will be ingested into the AWS cloud. Join builder Adrian De Luca on this special episode of This is My Architecture as he learns about the international collaboration between the UAE\u0027s Mohammed Bin Rashid Space Centre and the University of Colorado’s Laboratory for Atmospheric and Space Physics. We explore how the probe\u0027s imaging instruments were built, the challenges of sending signals in space and processing vast amounts of data. We dive deep into the event-driven solutions architecture to understand how they collect images and telemetry data with Amazon S3, AWS Lambda and Amazon Simple Queue Service (SQS). We also learn how they process it all with using serverless services like AWS Step Functions and AWS Batch, and distribute it to the scientific community through a secure web application built using Amazon Cloudfront, Amazon Cognito and Amazon API Gateway.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/mohammed-bin-rashid-space-center-logo%401x.381f3c68f8de7fd61b629246c410cc85d1de755b.png","displayLocation":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Telecommunications","sortDate":"2021-12-01","headlineUrl":"https://youtu.be/PrX-JNQTxac?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2021","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Emirates Mars Mission: Hope Probe","customer-name":"Mohammed Bin Rashid Space Centre"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#sqs","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Simple Queue Service (SQS)","description":"Amazon Simple Queue Service (SQS)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:36+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:02+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#uae","locale":"en