 learning for an end-to-end data strategy.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2024-02-14T22:32:15+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-02-14T22:32:15+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#astrazeneca-machine-learning-video-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"astrazeneca-machine-learning-video-case-study","dateCreated":"2023-09-06T22:56:19+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-03-02T02:48:50+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"In this presentation, hear about AstraZeneca’s journey to build a flexible, compliant platform to accelerate their drug research process, and how it collaborated with the Amazon Machine Learning (ML) Solutions Lab to make it happen.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/astrazeneca_Logo%401x.17b667208f14e5b450ebf1e95ecba0c85fda3328.png","displayLocation":"United Kingdom","customerNameLower":"astrazeneca","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Life Sciences","sortDate":"2021-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/astrazeneca-machine-learning-video-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Astrazeneca","publishedDate":"2021","enableShare":"1","headline":"AstraZeneca Transforms Pharmaceutical Research and Development with Industrialized Machine Learning on AWS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#location#uk","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"United Kingdom","description":"United Kingdom","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:30:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:52+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#ai-ml","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Machine Learning \u0026 AI","description":"Machine Learning \u0026 AI","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#sagemaker","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon SageMaker","description":"Amazon SageM