d specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#big-rocks#aws-for-data","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#big-rocks","name":"AWS for Data","description":"\u003cp\u003eAWS for Data is a marketing \u0026ldquo;Big Rock\u0026rdquo; initiative that tells the story around how AWS can provide the most comprehensive set of data capabilities spanning databases, analytics, business intelligence, and machine learning for an end-to-end data strategy.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2024-02-14T22:32:15+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-02-14T22:32:15+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#nexity","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"nexity","dateCreated":"2023-07-18T00:09:30+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-08-11T22:26:57+0000","additionalFields":{"videoSrcUrl":"https://youtu.be/50oVXmybLhM","descriptionSummary":"\u003cp\u003ePort\u0026eacute; par une conviction forte que l\u0026#39;IT doit se concentrer sur des activit\u0026eacute;s diff\u0026eacute;renciantes \u0026agrave; forte valeur ajout\u0026eacute;e, Nexity a engag\u0026eacute; depuis 2016 un virage \u0026agrave; 180\u0026deg; vers le cloud. En utilisant les services manag\u0026eacute;s AWS, le groupe a pu r\u0026eacute;aliser des gains significatifs en termes d\u0026#39;agilit\u0026eacute; et de performance, tout en r\u0026eacute;duisant les co\u0026ucirc;ts ainsi que son empreinte carbone.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Nexity%20-%20logo.072051fcd1e2b9b9b77f45e38878c25c3bccf15f.png","displayLocation":"Europe, Moyen-Orient et Afrique","footerInfoText":"Date de publication","industry":"Construction et immobilier","sortDate":"2021-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/fr/solutions/case-studies/nexity/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Nexity","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2021","contentType":"Témoignages clients","headline":"Nexity propulse sa Direction des Solutions et Innovations Numériques dans le cloud avec AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#robomaker","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS RoboMaker","description":"AWS RoboMaker","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:05+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:57+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#mwaa","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Managed Workflows for Apache Airflow (MWAA)","description":"Amazon Managed Workflows for Apache Airflow (MWAA)","dateCreated":"2021-08-28T07:04:25+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:52+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#snowball","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Snowball","description":"AWS Snowball","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:00+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#sso","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Single Sign-On (SSO)","description":"AWS Single Sign-On (SSO)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:37+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-06-01T00:45:24+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-cat